14. BORROW REPORT (JOIN QUERY)
-----------------------------

Command:
SELECT s.name, b.title, br.issue_date, br.due_date, br.return_date
FROM students s
JOIN borrow_records br ON s.student_id = br.student_id
JOIN book b ON br.book_id = b.book_id;

Output:
+----------+-----------------+------------+------------+-------------+
| name     | title           | issue_date | due_date   | return_date |
+----------+-----------------+------------+------------+-------------+
| Ananya   | Java            | 2025-01-01 | 2025-01-10 | 2025-01-12  |
| Ashlesha | Data Structue   | 2025-01-05 | 2025-01-15 | 2025-01-14  |
| Atharv   | DataBase System | 2025-01-08 | 2025-01-18 | NULL        |
+----------+-----------------+------------+------------+-------------+


==================================================


15. FINE CALCULATION
-------------------

Command:
SELECT record_id,
CASE
    WHEN return_date > due_date
    THEN DATEDIFF(return_date, due_date) * 5
    ELSE 0
END AS fine
FROM borrow_records;

Output:
+-----------+------+
| record_id | fine |
+-----------+------+
| 1         | 10   |
| 2         | 0    |
| 3         | 0    |
+-----------+------+


==================================================


16. SEARCH BY TITLE
------------------

Command:
SELECT * FROM book WHERE title LIKE '%Java%';

Output:
