| 1       | Java  | James Gosling | Programming | 5            | 3                |
+---------+-------+---------------+-------------+--------------+------------------+


==================================================


17. SEARCH BY CATEGORY
---------------------

Command:
SELECT * FROM book WHERE category = 'Programming';

Output:
+---------+-------+---------------+-------------+--------------+------------------+
| 1       | Java  | James Gosling | Programming | 5            | 3                |
+---------+-------+---------------+-------------+--------------+------------------+


==================================================


18. SEARCH WITH MULTIPLE FILTERS
-------------------------------

Command:
SELECT * FROM book
WHERE author LIKE '%Mark%'
AND category = 'CS';

Output:
+---------+---------------+------------+----------+--------------+------------------+
| 2       | Data Structue | Mark Allen | CS       | 4            | 2                |
+---------+---------------+------------+----------+--------------+------------------+


==================================================


19. NOT RETURNED BOOKS
---------------------

Command:
SELECT s.name, b.title, br.issue_date, br.due_date
FROM borrow_records br
JOIN students s ON br.student_id = s.student_id
JOIN book b ON br.book_id = b.book_id
WHERE br.return_date IS NULL;

Output:
+--------+-----------------+------------+------------+
| name   | title           | issue_date | due_date   |
+--------+-----------------+------------+------------+
| Atharv | DataBase System | 2025-01-08 | 2025-01-18 |
+--------+-----------------+------------+------------+


